---
title: Peanut Butter Pork Noodles
description: Fast 25-minute weeknight noodle dinner featuring crispy seared pork mince, chewy udon noodles, and a rich, tangy peanut butter sauce with chilli crisp.
servings: 1
prep time: 10 minutes
cook time: 15 minutes
source: https://www.andy-cooks.com/de/blogs/recipes/peanut-butter-pork-noodles
image: https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0725/3911/1726/files/20260814054749-andy-20cooks_peanut-20butter-20pork-20noodles-029.jpg?v=1786686472&width=1600&height=900
